   "text": "这一切都会回来。交叉熵、梯度和曲率，是第9和第11部分里每个网络的训练方式，而softmax就是多类的逻辑回归。第7部分搭建统计模型：主成分、混合模型、贝叶斯。第8部分追问一个模型为什么能泛化，并遇到神经正切核，一个表现得像核机器的网络。第13部分把注意力读作核平滑器，而第31部分对语言模型提出我们对朴素贝叶斯提过的同一个问题：它的概率诚实吗？",
   "raw": "All of it comes back. Cross-entropy, gradients and curvature are how every network in Parts 9 and 11 is trained, and the softmax is logistic regression with many classes. Part 7 builds the statistical models: principal components, mixtures, Bayes. Part 8 asks why a model generalizes at all, and meets the neural tangent kernel, a network that behaves like a kernel machine. Part 13 reads attention as a kernel smoother, and Part 31 asks the same question of language models that we asked of naive Bayes: are its probabilities honest?",
